    <text>
        <body>
            <div xml:id="d78">

                <pb facs="0082" n="74" sameAs="frus:frus1937v04/pg74"/>

                <note rend="inline" type="source">793.94 Conference/55</note>
                <head><hi rendition="#italic">The Chinese Embassy to the Department of
                    State</hi></head>
                <p>The Chinese Ambassador has been informed that the Belgian Government is hesitant
                    about having Brussels as the venue of the Nine <pb facs="0083" n="75"
                        xml:id="pg75"/> Power Conference because of the attitude of certain European
                    Powers. It is requested that the United States Government will be good enough to
                    propose London instead and do everything possible to expedite the
                    Conference.</p>
                <closer>
                    <dateline rendition="#float-left">[<placeName>
                            <hi rendition="#small-caps">Washington</hi>
                        </placeName>,] <date calendar="gregorian" when="1937-10-14">October 14,
                            1937</date>.</dateline>
                </closer>
            </div>
        </body>
    </text>
